      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we need to check NetworkCapabilities for following reasons:\n1) NetworkCapabilities is not used in this code path\n2) Although if NetworkCapabilities is null, the Network must not be functional, there is not much value for setUnderlyingNetwork to really check if an Network is functional or not. Thus it just needs to do very limited check to ensure the parameter it wants to access exists. For example, the LinkProperties.\n3) If we add a null check for NetworkCapabilities, we might add another failure point that cause this method to throw without gaining much benefit.\n\n\nThus I updated the API doc to make it more consistent with the actually code",
